{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/133e25240fad2331d53fd462adf2c120.avif?t=1766583037\" width=800 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.poster.avif?t=1766583037\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.webm?t=1766583037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.mp4?t=1766583037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of pure joy with the game <strong><i>Campoca</i></strong>. This game is  your go-to feel-good experience, filled with fun minigames and surprises!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/81409afd9e52cf820cb1c8b47b89f2e3.avif?t=1766583037\" width=800 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an interactive wonderland where every element is designed to bring a smile to your face. This game brings happiness right into your heart with very simple controls - just bring your mouse or trackpad!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/38c1aa7f8d267b0d0475173ea0fcdd72.avif?t=1766583037\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"b